# 发布 @veren/* 到私有 registry：token 只放在 gitignore 的根 .env（NPM_TOKEN=
# 行），market/release.mjs 自动加载；pnpm publish 不认 CLI 上的
# `--//host/:_authToken=`，所以发布时 token 经系统临时目录的专用 .npmrc
# （NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG）传给子进程，用完即删——不进仓库文件、不进 argv。
# token 值从桌面 profile 只读复制；外部导出的 NPM_TOKEN 优先于 .env：
#   # 仓库根 .env:  NPM_TOKEN=<C:\Users\imeep\.dsh\profiles\desktop\.npmrc 里 //npm.veren.top/:_authToken 的值>
#   node market/release.mjs
# Publishing @veren/* goes through the private registry and the token lives only
# in the gitignored root .env (its NPM_TOKEN= line), which market/release.mjs
# loads. `pnpm publish` ignores a `--//host/:_authToken=` CLI flag, so the token
# travels through a dedicated .npmrc under the system temp dir
# (NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG) and is deleted right after — never into a committed
# file, never into argv. Copy the value read-only from the desktop profile
# .npmrc; an exported NPM_TOKEN takes precedence over .env:
#   # root .env:  NPM_TOKEN=<//npm.veren.top/:_authToken in the desktop profile .npmrc>
#   node market/release.mjs
# 项目级覆盖用户全局的 node-linker=hoisted：hoisted 把同一个 DSH 包复制成
# 多条物理路径（根顶层的真实目录 + 各包 node_modules 里的 .pnpm 链接），
# brand symbol 按模块路径区分，两条路径即两个 symbol，同名类型互不兼容。
# isolated 保证每个包名只解析到一个物理实例。
# Project-level override of the user-global node-linker=hoisted: hoisting
# copies one DSH package into several physical locations (a real directory at
# the workspace root plus per-package .pnpm links). Brand symbols are keyed by
# module path, so two paths mean two symbols and incompatible nominal types.
# isolated keeps exactly one physical instance per package name.
node-linker=isolated
# 关闭 peer 自动安装（pnpm v10 默认开）：dsh 旧发布把 peer 锁成精确版本，自动
# 安装会把两个世代的 dsh-* 同时拉进依赖树，dsh-tools 的 peer 组合随 importer
# 分裂成多个 .pnpm 条目（同版本多物理副本，brand symbol 按路径分裂）。本仓
# devDependencies 已放精确副本，peer 缺失只在加载期才需要宿主供给。
# Disable peer auto-install (pnpm v10 default): old dsh releases pin peers to
# exact versions, so auto-install pulls two generations of dsh-* into one tree
# and splits dsh-tools' peer combination into several .pnpm entries per importer
# (same version, several physical copies — brand symbols split by path). Our
# devDependencies already carry exact copies; missing peers are the host's job
# at load time, not install time.
auto-install-peers=false
# 把依赖树里已有的包也链接到根 node_modules：工作区的包历史上靠 hoisted 布局
# 提升上来的根顶层目录解析第三方包与 DSH 运行时包（zod、dsh-storage、
# cordis-plugin-* 等），isolated 下这些"幻影依赖"会集体失败。public-hoist 用
# **链接**提升，所有入口仍指向 .pnpm 里的同一个条目，物理副本保持唯一。
# Also link every package already in the tree into the root node_modules: the
# workspace packages historically resolved third-party and DSH runtime packages
# (zod, dsh-storage, cordis-plugin-*, …) through root-level copies hoisted by the
# old layout, and isolated makes those phantom imports fail. public hoisting
# promotes them as **links**, so every entry still points at one .pnpm entry and
# the physical copy stays unique.
shamefully-hoist=true
